    {
      "id": "L-S2E04-C05",
      "title": "Hope tells Landon they were in love.",
      "description": "Hope tries to talk Landon out of sacrificing himself and ends up telling him that the monsters are her fault, that she went into the pit to save him, and that they were in love. Only then does she realize the Oni already has him.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Possessed by Oni"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "forgotten",
        "love",
        "confession",
        "sacrifice",
        "angst",
        "trust"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": false,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Hey. Josie dropped the barrier spell so I could get in. There's a demon loose inside the school somewhere. We have to get you to somewhere safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "There is nowhere safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Okay, well, somewhere safer than here."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "If this is the one thing that can kill an Oni, what if it's the one thing that can kill a phoenix, too?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Josie told me that you think the monsters being back is your fault. But it isn't."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "What do you know about it?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Too much. Trust me, Landon, even though you might have the best intentions, not every sacrifice is worth it. No matter how much you think it is."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "You said this isn't my fault?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "It isn't."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "Then whose is it?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "That doesn't matter. We need to..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "It matters to me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "It's my fault. I'm the one that went into the pit. It was the only way to save you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "Why would you want to save me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Because we were... we were friends."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "Come on, there had to be more to it than that. Tell me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You're gonna hate me if I do."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "Let me make that decision for myself."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "We were in love."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, I know that you don't remember. I know that it doesn't make any sense. But I can't let you risk your life because I tried to give up mine to save it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "So, uh, we have to find another solution. One that doesn't involve you being possessed."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C05-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Possessed by Oni"
            },
            "text": "It's too late."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
