            "text": "Uh, yeah, that moved you here? Yeah. Didn't really want you bursting into flames in the middle of town square."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C06-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "That's not what I'm talking about."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C06-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Why do I see you every time I die?"
          }
        ]
      }
