      "title": "Alaric asks Hope what is really holding her back from Landon.",
      "description": "Alaric thanks Hope for helping his daughters and pushes her about Landon. She admits she is afraid he would still choose Josie, and says she is going to finish what she started with Malivore instead.",
      "participants": [
