          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "I should have been there tonight. With you and the girls. I got distracted from what matters most. Thank you. I don't know what would have happened to Lizzie or Josie if you hadn't have been there."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "They're stronger than you think. They didn't need my help."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Maybe. And what about Landon?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "For the last time, I'm not going back."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope, you told me that you and Landon shared an epic love. So what's really holding you back?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I mean, what if I tell him everything, and he still wants to be with Josie?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "I don't know. But are you really gonna live the rest of your life without finding out?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E04-C07-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "What I found was the portal to Malivore. And what I'm gonna do is finish what I started at the pit. But this time, I'm gonna get it right."
          }
        ]
